Gets the array of data pointers directly into the arrays (never into the buffers), corresponding to iteration index 0. These pointers are different from the pointers accepted by NpyIter_ResetBasePointers, because the direction along some axes may have been reversed. This function may be safely called without holding the Python GIL. 
